
>> Product := Ntho ncha.
Product ha-ho-fihla: ['a'] etsa: { :price
	Sephetho ngola: ['cost ']+ price.
}.
>> Apples := Product ncha.
Sephetho ngola: ['Apples cost: '].
Apples a 60.
Sephetho ngola: [' cent a piece.'].


Palo ha-ho-fihla: ['X'] etsa: { :b
	b × uena. 
}.
7 X { :i Sephetho ngola: i. }.
